<title>USA: American Radio Systems purchase offer ends.</title>
<headline>American Radio Systems purchase offer ends.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Radio Systems Corp said Wednesday its offer to purchase its outstanding 9.75 percent Senior Subordinated Notes due 2005 expired as scheduled at 1700 EDT/2100 GMT, May 19.</p>
<p>No extension of the offer has been or will be made, the company said.</p>
</text>
